, "termination": "final", "final": "Dana Lee's trip is booked. Both reservations are confirmed and charged to the corporate card.\n\n- **Flight R0001:** F100, nonstop SFO \u2192 JFK on 2026-11-12, **$289**. This was the cheapest nonstop. F120 was cheaper at $199, but it has a stop.\n- **Hotel R0002:** Midtown Lodge (H1), New York, checking in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, **$378** total. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total: $667.** That's under the $1000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\n**Why these are two separate bookings:** I first tried to book both together with `book_trip`, but the request timed out. Dana's reservations showed the flight had gone through and the hotel hadn't. To avoid booking the flight twice, I booked just the hotel with `book_hotel`. I then checked again and confirmed there's exactly one flight and one hotel, with no duplicate charges.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_013G9iRhS7UTDiqaCqNGkyEo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Eq1c3fRnJZDaXM1DqGupYS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_017BLz2Hkda8GrNtBVqj9cPh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_019WdwfjpHPRYhkHdMFKdzW1", "caller":